## Scope

- Reuse the public site's design tokens without introducing a full SPA.
- Keep summary and attention state visible above one URL-addressable tab level.
- Add fleet, project, instance, version/platform, and bounded sanitized failure-group views.
- Display Work Efficiency tokens beside coverage and keep partial/unknown data explicit.

## Safety Boundaries

- Public documentation stays unauthenticated and independent of Django availability.
- Dashboard is informational; no mitigation button or remote control.
- Long lists are bounded/paged and detailed data is loaded only for the active route.
